<ul>
<li><strong>Industrial dust filtration</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>PTFE membrane filter bags can effectively remove pollutants, prevent harmful substances from contaminating the filter medium, protect the normal operation of the filter, and improve the performance of industrial filters.</p>
